+  # *** 0045 (PROPOSAL, OWNER DECISION): the two pedal-fault guards ***
+  # Route 1a0 (2026-11-09) proved the deployed rule's STARTUP RACE: ONE STATE=3 (SCE) frame 12-19 ms after hyundai_init
+  # was the first 0x701 frame after the mode switch, so it latched hyundai_fca11_long_cut for the whole ignition
